  "notes": "Cash basis county. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 872,244 split into Property 821,610 and Motor vehicle 50,634 using the Statement of Activities general receipts (p2), which add exactly to it; fund-level Taxes lines (General 710,247, Road Bond 161,997) stay taxes. Local 249,477 equals SoA charges for services 103,807 + operating grants 2,079 + interest 121,326 + miscellaneous 22,265; no category is more than half, kept other. Sale of assets 3,895 is other_financing. Beginning fund balance as originally stated 4,722,279 with prior period adjustment (Note 12) 22,625 in adjustments (restated 4,744,904). Roll-forward 4,722,279 + 22,625 + 1,918,725 - 2,509,988 + 661,211 - 661,211 + 3,895 = 4,157,536. Beginning cash not printed (only fund balances); ending cash = total assets on p3 (all cash). Capital outlay lines print no function, labelled Capital Outlay. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p8) instead of its combining column; Inheritance Tax Fund column from the General Fund combining statement (p5; Veteran's Aid column all zero); Road, Road Bond and Emergency Road budget schedules (pp9-11); non-major funds per fund column from the combining statement (pp6-7; no disbursements printed). Read pages 1-11 of 11"
